8	// This file pins the convergence contract between the two reports that
9	// classify dataset-level changes for the same old -> new transition:
10	//
11	//   - the batch report (PreviewBatch / ApplyBatch) for a plan that turns one
12	//     graph into another, and
13	//   - the snapshot comparison (CompareSnapshots) of the two versions,
14	//
15	// must agree on newDatasets, removedDatasets, and changedDatasets, because
16	// both are computed by the single shared rule in diffDatasets. The reports
17	// keep their distinct remaining meanings: the batch report's
18	// affectedDownstreams and the comparison's rootSourceChanges answer different
19	// questions and are not unified.
